`POST /api/v1/storage/download`

Storage object paths are unique across the entire bucket, not per tenant. Prefix paths with the tenant ID or another unique namespace, for example `tenants/<tenant_id>/avatars/me.png`.

## Request body

Content type: `application/json`

```json
{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "path": {
      "description": "Bucket-wide object path. Prefix with the tenant ID or another unique namespace.",
      "examples": [
        "tenants/00000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000000/avatars/me.png"
      ],
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "path"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}
```

## Responses

### 200

OK

```json
{
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "properties": {
    "download_url": {
      "type": "string"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "download_url"
  ],
  "type": "object"
}
```

### 400

Bad Request

```json
{
  "title": "Bad Request",
  "status": 400,
  "detail": "The request could not be processed."
}
```

### 401

Unauthorized

```json
